{"id": 235, "forum": "3-fontany", "title": "Фонтан по технологии БКВ в Агалатово", "posts": [{"id": 1731, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2018-06-20", "html": "<p>Мы преступили к реконструкции существующего водоёма, в результате которой должен получиться фонтан по технологии БКВ.</p><p>Демонтаж старой гидроизоляции произведён:</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_8ad2875292ac6983f907ff94d514d2e2", "thumb": "", "name": "geo002.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_3ac7aeef7c4b18f01fc319c61aa66a31", "thumb": "", "name": "geo001.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_276066534bda17f19897bb1e2f337c68", "thumb": "", "name": "kor003.jpg"}]}, {"id": 1732, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2018-06-20", "html": "<p>Акваблоки доставлены на объект</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_22fcc42c7d3e1415fea19ac435fd2bc5", "thumb": "", "name": "IMG-20180619-WA0007.jpg"}]}, {"id": 1738, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2018-06-25", "html": "<p>Проверка гидроизоляции</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_6a688ec3a9865b9a3280c06c0600aff7", "thumb": "", "name": "agf001.jpg"}]}, {"id": 1739, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2018-06-25", "html": "<p>Монтаж оборудования</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_00194d587e6452c8e3b35cfa08b6bb89", "thumb": "", "name": "agf002.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_d16f3f7ed924f8d92981ef7b432da08d", "thumb": "", "name": "agf003.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_7cad4cb1783a037a3e26cc32279d4dc6", "thumb": "", "name": "agf004.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_a5e0235a0adbb720286c960d8177d37f", "thumb": "", "name": "agf005.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_d9faa7af46b2c09172bb21d7bceb2b9c", "thumb": "", "name": "agf006.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_947e51d4bf4c16e27ef63fae6cc676a6", "thumb": "", "name": "agf007.jpg"}]}, {"id": 1743, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2018-07-02", "html": "<p>Дренажные блоки установлены, уложены крупные камни</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_ddb5bddad684345ccb592ff01a9f0234", "thumb": "", "name": "agf008.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_3ed5c21d36b3978e14c4078e92883284", "thumb": "", "name": "agf009.jpg"}]}, {"id": 1758, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2018-07-12", "html": "<p>Борт фонтана делаем из гранитной брусчатки</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_2024eaedc7921b7e4812ae30aa435894", "thumb": "", "name": "agf010.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_ebcdd1118ffe92d933c248c2e270b862", "thumb": "", "name": "agf011.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_04c07e4e5ef3debe6e991362443bfc0b", "thumb": "", "name": "agf012.jpg"}]}, {"id": 1783, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2018-08-31", "html": "<p>Установка декоративной композиции</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_e601f6ca7a128f6b42ddd75c85e933cb", "thumb": "", "name": "agf013.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_092b7bf5abb0b9a7485fef79b507411e", "thumb": "", "name": "agf014.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_7cdc1f1f715b064a74f43f58ae7dd9b5", "thumb": "", "name": "agf015.jpg"}]}, {"id": 1834, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2018-10-15", "html": "<p>Проведены работы по поднятию чаши фонтана относительно уровня земли. Фонтанная композиция собрана. <br>Строительство фонтана завершено</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_5bbaa8898d652647ee530320a952f7e3", "thumb": "", "name": "agf016.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_f73f9c3404c836850c80baa10b7f9f82", "thumb": "", "name": "agf017.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_3405dc4a4022cf5461637de133f26a73", "thumb": "", "name": "agf018.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_2f8ba1a47b1bf90eb5f04b1adafcf189", "thumb": "", "name": "agf019.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_61c42ae9ff4ff0f073ecead3323dfb7a", "thumb": "", "name": "agf020.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_b0c162c00d487808b0f71ff7dad3df20", "thumb": "", "name": "agf021.jpg"}]}]}